   "gameId": "nova-hearts-280389",
   "displayName": "New update: Story Mode and Steam Cloud Save!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2025-09-09T13:10:41.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello summer lovers,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "To start the school year on the right track, we're coming with an update! We've carefully read your feedback and tried to respond the best we can with an update and a few guides. We've added the Steam Cloud Save, and a \"story mode\" where you can't instant-win the combat!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Patchnote",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Added",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Steam Cloud Save",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "During combat, an instant win button",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "During combat, a new pop-up",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed/Balancing",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Increased the amount of relationship points gained to unlock relationship episodes more easily",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Main content videos unlocked in the gallery app",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Updated credits text",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Removed some extra text for some sentences in the Brazilian language",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Guides",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We've also created a few guides to help you in your stellar journey ✨",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Relationship mechanics",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "If you're curious about how the relationship system works in Nova Hearts, here are some insights and a little explanation on how to unlock some hidden selfies and hot pics 🔥",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[dynamiclink href=\"https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3537418389\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Final boss fight",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We heard that our last boss (whoever it is 👀) is not the easiest to beat! So here are some tips to defeat it!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
